  "sourceTitle": "People keep asking how I'm running Qwen3.8 27b @ 160k context on a 16 GB card, so here's the whole thing. No tricks, no 8-bit KV hacks, no CPU offload party trickery — just a quirk of the model's architecture and a couple of flag choices.",
  "sourceBodyHash": "325bce881387614a972081b5c798d2d9509c471232a8fe1298c4459176556758",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "partial",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "groq",
  "requestedModel": "glm-4.7-flash",
  "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-26T09:55:38.980503Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-10T12:57:52.447200Z",
  "totalBlocks": 25,
  "translatedBlocks": 19,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a69fb7898b6c436b",
      "translationZh": "我询问了 Qwen3.8 这是如何实现的，因为它运行得非常好，说实话，这就像拥有一个本地的 claude 一样。我做过一些少样本提示（few-shot prompts），比如多平面飞行模拟器等。即使在这个低量化（low quant）水平下，效果也令人惊叹。以下是 Qwen3.8 27b 提供的关于其配置方式的详细信息。真是元（meta）得令人发笑。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "30ff24546527fe08",
      "translationZh": "CPU：i7-8700（6核/12线程），32 GB DDR4",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6862014940655674",
      "translationZh": "**驱动路径：** Vulkan (RADV)，而非 ROCm —— 使用 `--device Vulkan1`，因为 `Vulkan0` 是我的 Intel 核显",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d34e5aad2359a083",
      "translationZh": "**llama.cpp `llama-server`**，构建版本 **10480**（提交 `01818e495`），Vulkan 构建。它只是在本地主机上运行的一个 OpenAI 兼容 API——我是通过 pi（一个编码智能体）来驱动它的，但任何",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee1b7ec29b8c8d89",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI 兼容客户端可用。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a08f19bcc0d60dd",
      "translationZh": "模型：**unsloth `Qwen3.8-27B-UD-IQ3_XXS`** -- 10.2 GiB GGUF，原生支持 262k 上下文。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a26e16fe3bf5e75f",
      "translationZh": "影响上下文大小的两个关键标志：-c 163840 以及较小的计算缓冲区 -b 512 -ub 256。在此配置中，MTP / 推测解码处于关闭状态。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe76f8ab68de3c9c",
      "translationZh": "为什么 160k 能装进 16 GB（听起来像是编造的部分）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea490730ec48180d",
      "translationZh": "这个 GGUF 是一个混合模型，而非稠密注意力模型。其 64 层中只有 16 层保留完整的 KV 缓存；其余 48 层则持有恒定大小的 SSM 状态。因此 KV 仅为：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff6961085138ed2a",
      "translationZh": "16 层 × 4 个 KV 头 × (256 K + 256 V)，在 q8_0 量化下 ≈ 34 KB/token",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e7e85d29f44e2a2f",
      "translationZh": "以及 163840 × 34 KB ≈ 5.3 GiB 的 KV。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4dd6661b38818f4e",
      "translationZh": "预算：约 10.2 GiB 权重 + 约 5.3 GiB KV + 约 0.9 GiB 计算/SSM 开销 ≈ 约 16.4 GiB，对比 16 GB 显存——因此这正好处于边缘，脚本的预检 VRAM 警告是预期且正常的。你并没有发生 OOM，已验证可正常工作。（如果你的解码速度降至约 6 t/s 而不是约 18 t/s，那是你的 GPU 正在向系统内存溢出，而不是崩溃——请减少上下文。）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "41ecd0cbf655dfd1",
      "translationZh": "根据用户配置测量的数值",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "00aa9949b5e8b9c4",
      "translationZh": "在 1.8k 个 token 的提示词上，预填充速度为 141 t/s",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0affc5175c9fd3f",
      "translationZh": "供参考，同一模型开启 MTP 时：在 98k 上下文下约为 24 t/s，在 124k 下约为 39 t/s。因此，160k 是关闭 MTP 时的权衡结果：更长的上下文，采用普通解码。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "929f9253d1312850",
      "translationZh": "160k 是显存计算的极限，而非质量声明——别指望模型读完 150k 个 token 后还能记住第 1 页的内容，我可做不到 :)",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "71247d7524c78a97",
      "translationZh": "你需要 GPU 处于空闲状态（后台没有 ComfyUI 占用 4 GB 内存）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ae68e126813c8f56",
      "translationZh": "模型将大部分输出放在 reasoning_content 中；仅渲染 content 的客户端会显示空白气泡——在责怪服务器之前，请先检查原始响应",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b84f4cc63512b6d3",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/According_Study_162 提交",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    }
  ],
